{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297927","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297927","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1029792701:1":{"text":"我看过了报告，没想到你们进度有这么快！","source_cn":"我看过了报告，没想到你们进度有这么快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8218444BD38CD09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029792702:1":{"text":"这次有秘银商会支持，整体运营上有什么困难吗？","source_cn":"这次有秘银商会支持，整体运营上有什么困难吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31538FC481974F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029792703:1":{"text":"生产和销售那些没问题，做订单嘛，深岩村的人干这个比我熟。","source_cn":"生产和销售那些没问题，做订单嘛，深岩村的人干这个比我熟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCB59BFA21D3FC05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029792704:1":{"text":"只不过和别的地方比，这里不太适合迎接游客。","source_cn":"只不过和别的地方比，这里不太适合迎接游客。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FBFA8E38AB5674A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029792705:1":{"text":"看来看去，除了那些草啊石头啊，就只有工坊、村子和矿洞，为了处理订单还在连轴转。","source_cn":"看来看去，除了那些草啊石头啊，就只有工坊、村子和矿洞，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A38AFBB1616C405","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029792706:1":{"text":"就算游客有兴趣参观，也没地方给他们看啊。","source_cn":"就算游客有兴趣参观，也没地方给他们看啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F833B6D2198DAA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029792707:1":{"text":"确实……之前那种亲手尝试生产武器的工坊体验，好像也没法让游客充分体验。","source_cn":"确实……之前那种亲手尝试生产武器的工坊体验，好像也没法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3595DF4E0C6BF6D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029792708:1":{"text":"最重要的是，村子里好像也没有适合招待客人的旅店啊。","source_cn":"最重要的是，村子里好像也没有适合招待客人的旅店啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9A175B8A84789CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029792709:1":{"text":"看起来深岩村要想发展，还得考虑考虑转型……","source_cn":"看起来深岩村要想发展，还得考虑考虑转型……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x833302EEC8097AA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"伊芙","source":"伊芙","status":"source"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"祖娅","source":"祖娅","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}